on 2026-11-04. These are syntax hints, not a version-aware validator.

The snippets in snippets/salt.json are original to this continuation
(Apache-2.0); no third-party snippet content is included.

The continuation changes the detected filetype to salt (retaining sls aliases),
replaces intrusive ftplugin behavior with undoable buffer-local defaults,
composes external YAML/Jinja syntax, and adds Salt-specific highlighting,
synthetic tests, CI and documentation. Modified runtime files are marked.

Generic YAML/Jinja syntax is loaded from the user's runtime, not redistributed
here. No Glench, HiPhish or GPL-marked donor ftplugin/indent code is bundled.
Those projects retain their own copyright and licenses.

This is an independent community continuation, not an endorsed official
ownership transfer. Contributor names identify provenance, not endorsement.
